~ start
Welcome to Midnight Dungeons!
This game is played using both the keyboard and mouse, however, you can change your settings to prioritize one over the other.

Pressing [lb][lb]Secondary[rb][rb] will skip the current dialogue line, allowing to be advanced immediately. Holding [lb][lb]Tertiary[rb][rb] will both skip and advance for as long as it's held.
...
=> choices

~ choices
- RPG Controls => rpg_controls
- RPG Menu => rpg_menu
- Exit => quit

~ rpg_controls
Pressing [lb][lb]Pause[rb][rb] will pause the game. Pressing [lb][lb]Tertiary[rb][rb] will bring up the menu. Lastly, holding [lb][lb]Quaternary[rb][rb] while moving will allow you to sprint.
...
=> choices

~ rpg_menu
The RPG menu contains four options\: "Resume", "Inventory", "Settings", and "Exit".
Pressing "Resume" will close the menu and bring you back to the world.
Pressing "Inventory" will open the inventory menu. This is where all of your unlocked items can be viewed and where you change your equipment.
Pressing "Settings" will open the settings menu.
Pressing "Exit" will exit back to the main menu.
...
=> choices

~ quit
Have fun playing the game!
=> END
